  "hints": [
    "Made by the generation server on the provider, paid in provider credits. The Model setting picks the model; resolution, shape and sound show what that model offers, with prices in the model's description.",
    "Each model takes its own range of lengths, its own frames and its own number of reference images (see its description); the server refuses a job that asks more, saying why.",
    "Reference images carry a character, product or look; cite them in the prompt as @Image1, @Image2 … Only Seedance models combine references with first/last frames.",
    "With a first or last frame the clip takes that image's shape.",
    "Reference audio (on the models that take it) guides the clip's sound: a voice to speak in, music to move to.",
    "A reference video (on the models that take one) is continued or edited."
